        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In arcade simulator of beer brewing you will deal with the wishes of elves who have never tried beer! Brew from the ingredients, understand what elves need, remember who is who to reach the goal! Accustom all the elves to beer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656850/extras/bede809f01ea8c991f269ad68b7d1898.poster.avif?t=1762014986\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656850/extras/bede809f01ea8c991f269ad68b7d1898.webm?t=1762014986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656850/extras/bede809f01ea8c991f269ad68b7d1898.mp4?t=1762014986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine ingredients</strong> and give an elf what he wants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656850/extras/9d165845bd4a3d546f0d3a906498d848.poster.avif?t=1762014986\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656850/extras/9d165845bd4a3d546f0d3a906498d848.webm?t=1762014986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656850/extras/9d165845bd4a3d546f0d3a906498d848.mp4?t=1762014986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The elves will speak weirdly</strong>, ask you to add sugar in beer and sometimes interrupt the brewing process with new demands. The dwarf will have to figure out what drink they have been waiting their whole life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656850/extras/30f736d677a46a14bc6b2800363704ab.poster.avif?t=1762014986\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656850/extras/30f736d677a46a14bc6b2800363704ab.webm?t=1762014986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656850/extras/30f736d677a46a14bc6b2800363704ab.mp4?t=1762014986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elves that drink beer become similar to dwarfs:</strong> demanding and assertive, they won't budge or leave without a refill. And tavern needs new visitors! The main thing is to remember who is who. But how do you distinguish them? Definitely not by their faces, but by name, appearance or even hair.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In arcade simulator of beer brewing you will deal with the wishes of elves who have never tried beer! Brew from the ingredients, understand what elves need, remember who is who to reach the goal! Accustom all the elves to beer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656850/extras/bede809f01ea8c991f269ad68b7d1898.poster.avif?t=1762014986\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656850/extras/bede809f01ea8c991f269ad68b7d1898.webm?t=1762014986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656850/extras/bede809f01ea8c991f269ad68b7d1898.mp4?t=1762014986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine ingredients</strong> and give an elf what he wants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656850/extras/9d165845bd4a3d546f0d3a906498d848.poster.avif?t=1762014986\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656850/extras/9d165845bd4a3d546f0d3a906498d848.webm?t=1762014986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656850/extras/9d165845bd4a3d546f0d3a906498d848.mp4?t=1762014986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The elves will speak weirdly</strong>, ask you to add sugar in beer and sometimes interrupt the brewing process with new demands. The dwarf will have to figure out what drink they have been waiting their whole life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656850/extras/30f736d677a46a14bc6b2800363704ab.poster.avif?t=1762014986\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656850/extras/30f736d677a46a14bc6b2800363704ab.webm?t=1762014986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656850/extras/30f736d677a46a14bc6b2800363704ab.mp4?t=1762014986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elves that drink beer become similar to dwarfs:</strong> demanding and assertive, they won't budge or leave without a refill. And tavern needs new visitors! The main thing is to remember who is who. But how do you distinguish them? Definitely not by their faces, but by name, appearance or even hair.</p>",
